00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:38.380
<i>Deep within a remote forest,
there stands the St. Luciana Academy.</i>

00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:43.690
<i>To shed light on the intrigue hidden
in this school for wealthy girls,</i>

00:01:43.690 --> 00:01:49.250
<i>Meg became a transfer student
and infiltrated it alone.</i>

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:18.160
<i>One night, Meg stopped a girl
named Yoko from committing suicide.</i>

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:24.760
<i>Yoko feared someone in the school,
and trembled as if possessed.</i>

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:34.360
<i>In the center of it all was
the exclusive Ishtar Club.</i>

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:38.110
<i>Once Meg was invited into the club,</i>

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:43.850
<i>she grew suspicious of Angelique,
the intelligent and beautiful leader,</i>

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:45.910
<i>and began her search.</i>

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:55.490
<i>But, suddenly, a mysterious
creature appeared and attacked her!</i>

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:17.750
Jo!

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:20.880
Jo! Jo! Jo!

00:03:21.690 --> 00:03:28.260
--Where was that thing holed up?
--How should I know?!

00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:32.260
I don't think playing
detective will end this.

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:34.430
Now things are interesting!

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:37.100
No, they're not!

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:41.510
I'm through with this!
It's nothing but freaky stuff...!

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:44.540
I don't like this!

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:47.710
--I'm with you starting today.
--Really?!

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:51.620
Yeah, taking that thing on by
yourself <i>would</i> be tough and all...

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:54.590
But... Jo...

00:03:54.590 --> 00:03:57.080
That uniform doesn't suit you.

00:03:59.360 --> 00:04:00.190
I see.

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:10.530
This is our latest transfer
student, Jo Carpenter-<i>san</i>!

00:04:10.530 --> 00:04:15.440
Because her father is a diplomat,
she's been overseas a long time,

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:20.120
but she returned alone
for next year's test.

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:30.140
Say, Kyohei-<i>oniichan</i>.

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:32.710
Do you think Jo snuck in all right?

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:36.580
She does stand out in that uniform...

00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:38.950
It's so not her!

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:45.820
Yes. Yes. I see. Understood.

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:55.330
They found drugs in that
sick Bailan daughter.

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:58.640
They suspect she was taking
it on a daily basis.

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:02.680
Moreover, it contains
a dangerous component

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:05.580
that numbs the thought processes.

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:08.610
--A type of trance effect.
--That means--

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:13.090
Yes. We need to tell them
not to eat the school's food.

00:05:13.090 --> 00:05:16.820
Kyohei-<i>kun</i>. Things may get
hectic, but we're counting on you.

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:17.880
Right!

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:23.490
Never mind Jo, will Meg
be able to endure it?

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:31.870
Dear Lord, I'm ever so happy
I can eat this meal today!

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:38.110
May I eat it? But of course!
Great, down the hatch!

00:05:38.610 --> 00:05:40.940
Don't eat anything here!

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:43.250
I can't do that!

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:47.150
I'm already starving enough as it is!

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:50.290
Do you want to have
hallucinations of monsters?

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:54.130
Monsters? Like what the Bailan girl saw?

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:57.900
Yeah, probably. Amy contacted me.

00:05:57.900 --> 00:05:59.400
Seriously?!

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:03.070
So everyone's eating that stuff?!

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:06.270
--Oh, Megumi-<i>san</i>...!
--Oh, Yoko...

00:06:06.270 --> 00:06:08.740
Oh, you're with Jo-<i>san</i>?

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:12.970
You're friends already even though
you're in different classes?

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:13.850
Yeah.

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:19.490
We're both transfer students, so
we're, like, on the same wavelength...

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:24.760
Ah. But any friend of Megumi-<i>san</i>
is a friend of mine, right?!

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:26.430
Yeah.

00:06:26.430 --> 00:06:31.760
Oh? You're not eating?
Lunch is almost over...

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:35.700
No, I'm not very hungry...

00:06:37.070 --> 00:06:37.870
Oh, my!

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:42.140
--Well, you see--
--Meg's on a diet.

00:06:42.140 --> 00:06:44.040
Stop that, Jo!

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:47.950
She's been eating fancy
meals until recently, so...

00:06:49.980 --> 00:06:53.250
You're just as funny as Megumi-<i>san</i>!

00:06:54.150 --> 00:06:56.920
Maybe I'll go on a diet too!

00:06:57.420 --> 00:07:00.390
May I have a moment of your time?

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:06.600
This morning, someone snuck into
our room and ravaged the place!

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:09.600
This is a breach of academy rules!

00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:14.230
The devil that violated our
sanctuary may be among us!

00:07:18.010 --> 00:07:24.520
Devil?! Talk about exaggerating!
She really is mental!

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:27.250
And those gloves are so on purpose!

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:31.790
I bet she's hiding the wound you
gave her! She's totally suspicious!

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:38.200
Once I learn who she is, I'm gonna
tear her up and spit her out!

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:41.130
Megumi-<i>san</i>...

00:07:41.130 --> 00:07:46.410
Would you kindly come with me?
We'd like to speak with you.

00:07:46.410 --> 00:07:48.740
No, I kindly won't!

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:52.610
Just go.

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:55.310
But...! Ow!

00:07:55.310 --> 00:08:00.080
--Get going!
--Okay! Fine!

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:13.330
Tell me, where are you from?

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:17.600
Oh, I'm from Earth... Just kidding.

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:21.910
It says in your transfer file
that you're from Okinawa...

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:26.080
Yeah, yeah! I'm from Okinawa...!

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:28.850
<i>What are you doing with that?!</i>

00:08:28.850 --> 00:08:33.850
Oh, my mistake. It says
you're from Hokkaido.

00:08:33.850 --> 00:08:37.620
Oh, really? Maybe I misunderstood...

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:42.690
Oh, my mistake again.
This is someone else's file.

00:08:45.630 --> 00:08:46.870
What's the deal?

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:49.470
Don't act big just
'cause you have manners!

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:52.530
If you got something to say, then say it!

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:57.070
Oh, are you sure? You don't mind?

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:04.250
What's the big idea?

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:07.810
You can't scare me like that!

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:10.510
Are you serious?!

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:15.060
Let Megumi-<i>san</i> go!

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:20.000
How will you take responsibility
for this if you're mistaken?!

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:21.330
Mistaken?

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:27.910
Megumi-<i>san</i> and I took a walk in
the courtyard early this morning!

00:09:27.910 --> 00:09:31.340
Can you trust my word?

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:42.050
--Thank you for saving me...!
--My pleasure.

00:09:42.050 --> 00:09:47.960
They seemed a little excessive,
so I felt it was a good opportunity.

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:52.760
And besides, we're both
guilty of the same secret!

00:09:53.630 --> 00:09:57.040
Lowerclassmen get together
next for swimming.

00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:59.370
Make sure you're not late!

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:01.810
Right! Thank you!

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:05.330
Don't be late yourself, Nadeshiko-<i>san</i>!

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:09.880
Jo! What're you doing?!

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:10.750
Nothing...

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:13.720
Don't embarrass me in
front of Nadeshiko-<i>san</i>!

00:10:13.720 --> 00:10:16.090
There's no one here.

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:20.720
Huh? Where did she go...?

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:31.200
That arrogant Ange needs to get real!

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:34.840
I'm not the kind to give
in to threats like that!

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:38.540
Are you listening, Jo?

00:10:38.540 --> 00:10:40.980
Jo, are you done changing?

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:46.320
Those are my favorite ones!

00:10:46.320 --> 00:10:50.420
Oh? I just put on whatever
underwear I could find.

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:53.960
Do you usually wear
other people's panties?!

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:56.130
We all share the same stuff,
even panties.

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:58.400
--Off.
--You don't need to tell me.

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:00.200
Come on, already!

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:02.570
Hold on! What if an enemy
showed up right now?!

00:11:02.570 --> 00:11:06.810
What?! You're the one who
usually wears skin-tight stuff!

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:09.040
It's easier to fight that way.

00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:22.890
You okay?

00:11:22.890 --> 00:11:26.660
I'm so tired! All I did
was swim lightly...

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:31.860
I totally might've gained weight.
I feel heavy somehow...

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:37.400
Megumi-<i>san</i>! Jo-<i>san</i>!

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:41.570
Be quiet and watch. Or would
you rather suffer again?

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:56.690
Meg! Stay with me!

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:59.210
Get up! You're okay now!

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:12.560
Jo!

00:12:39.930 --> 00:12:40.900
Meg!

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:43.500
Jo!

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:14.630
What now, Jo?!

00:13:19.740 --> 00:13:25.400
Use this to tell Sei they have
a huge piranha in their pool!

00:14:11.090 --> 00:14:12.620
Are you okay?!

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:15.630
Get outside! Get to the trailer!

00:14:15.630 --> 00:14:17.620
Right!

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:21.930
It showed up! A totally crazy one!

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:26.770
You're making no sense again!
Calm down and explain!

00:14:26.770 --> 00:14:30.980
A piranha girl...
err, a monster lives in the pool!

00:14:30.980 --> 00:14:35.210
All the students attacked us
like zombies! Things are bad!

00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:38.880
Oh, yeah! And Jo's fighting the monster!

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:41.150
So basically, there's a monster?!

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:44.620
Hello? Meg? Do you read me?!

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:46.990
Not again!

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:52.260
Don't think you can get away!

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:57.700
Let me go!

00:14:58.070 --> 00:15:01.530
Let me go, I say! Darn it!

00:15:03.010 --> 00:15:05.140
You've been chosen too.

00:15:06.910 --> 00:15:09.350
It's my duty to watch you.

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:13.310
Thanks to you, I was re-chosen
and was able to return here.

00:15:16.020 --> 00:15:18.520
This is the soup we always had!

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:20.250
Just drink it!

00:15:22.530 --> 00:15:25.050
I've done as you ordered.

00:15:52.490 --> 00:15:56.900
Who are you? Why are you here?

00:15:56.900 --> 00:15:58.660
I...

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:04.400
I was in New York long ago.

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:06.670
And?

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:08.770
I met Jo there--

00:16:08.770 --> 00:16:13.940
--Jo? The other transfer student?
--Yes.

00:16:14.310 --> 00:16:17.450
Jo is normally laid-back,

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:20.750
but there's no stopping
her when she gets mad.

00:16:29.490 --> 00:16:30.460
Meg!

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:36.070
What's going on?!

00:16:38.740 --> 00:16:43.200
Stop! I will allow no further violence!

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:56.320
You'll pay for giving me
the pain of this wound!

00:16:56.320 --> 00:17:00.390
See that? She's the one
controlling them all!

00:17:00.390 --> 00:17:02.990
No way...

00:17:02.990 --> 00:17:05.500
Nadeshiko-<i>sama</i>! This is
bad for your health!

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:06.400
Hurry!

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:08.330
Jo! Don't shoot!

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:12.070
They're just being controlled!
You'll kill them!

00:17:12.070 --> 00:17:14.630
They work for the monster!

00:17:15.670 --> 00:17:19.610
I know! But still, we have to save them!

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:28.210
Nadeshiko-<i>sama</i>! We're almost there!

00:17:54.150 --> 00:17:58.150
Yoko! Wake up! It's just an illusion!

00:17:58.150 --> 00:18:01.290
Meg! There's no point
unless we kill her!

00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:02.380
Jo!

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:21.510
She's finally out of control.

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:26.410
Her Metal Brain mutation
is at 88% and progressing.

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:31.350
Let's watch until the end.
She is our student, after all.

00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:58.240
How do you like this...?!

00:19:09.650 --> 00:19:13.890
Its head is gone! Don't tell me--

00:19:13.890 --> 00:19:14.920
Jo!

00:19:58.140 --> 00:19:59.900
Jo!

00:19:59.900 --> 00:20:03.740
It's me! Do you understand?! Jo!

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:05.610
Meg...

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:11.350
Ugh! You're such a dummy!
Don't scare me like that!

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:13.380
Did you shoot this?

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:17.620
Yeah! You were in real danger!

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:22.830
Tadah! Pretty, aren't they?

00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:26.260
Thank you, Megumi-<i>san</i>. For everything.

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:29.830
No biggie! It's all over and done with!

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:32.000
Now you just need to get better!

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:36.700
Say, Megumi-<i>san</i>. Will you
still be my friend from now on?

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:39.510
Of course!

00:20:39.510 --> 00:20:43.520
When you get better,
let's go somewhere yummy to eat!

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:44.880
Yeah!

00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:54.580
Jo...!

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:59.890
I lied to her...

00:21:05.400 --> 00:21:10.710
Sei said that the school's gone now...

00:21:10.710 --> 00:21:15.550
Why do you think Nadeshiko-<i>san</i>
turned into a monster like that?

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:20.150
She's one of many who were
sadly used by bad guys...

00:21:20.150 --> 00:21:23.520
Who do you mean by bad guys?!

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:25.720
The weak get eaten...

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:28.210
By the monsters inside themselves...!

00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:34.630
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:21:34.630 --> 00:21:39.160
Wait for me, Jo! Come on!

00:21:57.740 --> 00:22:05.420
I remained motionless within the crowd

00:22:05.420 --> 00:22:13.060
Not even the voice of my
tears carried on this street

00:22:13.060 --> 00:22:20.770
as my feelings of lonesomeness joined it

00:22:20.770 --> 00:22:30.140
In truth, everyone wants
to smile with each other,

00:22:30.140 --> 00:22:36.680
yet they get hurt
when they can't do it very well

00:22:36.680 --> 00:22:45.690
But someone will always
be there to watch,

00:22:45.690 --> 00:22:52.860
so let's walk together
beneath this sky

00:23:13.850 --> 00:23:16.720
<i>A giant crow abducts young women.</i>

00:23:16.720 --> 00:23:19.490
<i>A messenger of darkness stands
in the way of Jo and the others,</i>

00:23:19.490 --> 00:23:22.160
<i>who challenge the legend
of the city of terror!</i>

00:23:22.160 --> 00:23:26.290
<i>On the next Burst Angel:</i>
"Black Skies"
